(Welcome to ReadAble  your accessible reading companion.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This sample document is used for local development and testing of) Tj T*
(the ReadAble PDF Reader. It is never committed to the repository.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ReadAble helps users with dyslexia, low vision, and other reading) Tj T*
(challenges by offering customisable fonts, contrast themes, zoom) Tj T*
(controls, and seamless reading-progress resume.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Navigate using the Previous / Next buttons or type a page number) Tj T*
(directly into the input field. Your progress is saved automatically) Tj T*
(and resumed when you return.) Tj T*
