(Chapter 1: Getting Started with ReadAble) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.1  Creating an account) Tj T*
(     Sign up with your email address or phone number.) Tj T*
(     A verification token is sent to confirm your identity.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.2  Uploading your first document) Tj T*
(     Tap the Upload button on the Dashboard.) Tj T*
(     Supported formats: PDF, TXT, and image files.) Tj T*
(     Files are stored securely and linked to your account.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1.3  Opening the Reader) Tj T*
(     Click any document in your library to open the Reader view.) Tj T*
(     The Reader remembers the last page you were on.) Tj T*
ET
