(Chapter 2  Reading Features) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
0 -30 Td
(Chapter 2: Reading Features) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.1  Page navigation) Tj T*
(     Use the Previous and Next buttons to move between pages.) Tj T*
(     Jump directly to any page by typing the number and pressing Enter.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.2  Zoom controls) Tj T*
(     Increase or decrease zoom with the + / - buttons in the toolbar.) Tj T*
(     Reset zoom to 100% at any time.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.3  Light / Dark theme) Tj T*
(     Toggle between light and dark reading themes.) Tj T*
(     Your preference is saved across sessions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.4  Reading progress) Tj T*
(     Progress is saved automatically every time you turn a page.) Tj T*
(     Closing the tab or navigating away also triggers a save.) Tj T*
(     When you return, you resume exactly where you left off.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
